// 数值检查样张：逐帧统计平均亮度、亮像素包围盒、亮像素占比、朱橙占比与绘制耗时，不输出图片。
// 用法：node .agent/work/蒋葆增/probe.mjs 0,15,60 [step]
import path from 'node:path';
import {fileURLToPath} from 'node:url';
import {openChrome} from '../../../會呼吸的痛/開場樣圖/v2/chrome.mjs';

const here = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url));
const film = path.resolve(here, '../../../蒋葆增的家国情怀/短片');
const arg = process.argv[2];
const frames = arg.includes('-') ? (() => { const [a, b, st] = arg.split('-').map(Number); const out = []; for (let n = a; n <= b; n += st || 1) out.push(n); return out; })() : arg.split(',').map(Number);

const STATS = `(() => {
  const c = document.getElementById('stage'), g = c.getContext('2d');
  const d = g.getImageData(0, 0, c.width, c.height).data;
  let sum = 0, lit = 0, orange = 0, x0 = 1e9, y0 = 1e9, x1 = -1, y1 = -1;
  for (let y = 0; y < c.height; y += 2) for (let x = 0; x < c.width; x += 2) {
    const i = (y * c.width + x) * 4, r = d[i], gg = d[i + 1], b = d[i + 2];
    const l = 0.2126 * r + 0.7152 * gg + 0.0722 * b;
    sum += l;
    if (l > 70) { lit++; if (x < x0) x0 = x; if (y < y0) y0 = y; if (x > x1) x1 = x; if (y > y1) y1 = y; }
    if (r > 180 && gg > 60 && gg < 140 && b < 90) orange++;
  }
  const n = c.width * c.height / 4;
  return {mean: +(sum / n).toFixed(1), lit: +(lit / n * 100).toFixed(2), orange: +(orange / n * 100).toFixed(2), box: x1 < 0 ? null : [x0, y0, x1, y1]};
})()`;

const chrome = await openChrome();
try {
  await chrome.openStyle('film', film);
  for (const n of frames) {
    const t0 = Date.now();
    await chrome.evaluate(`window.film.renderFrame(${n})`);
    const ms = Date.now() - t0;
    const s = await chrome.evaluate(STATS);
    console.log(JSON.stringify({n, ms, ...s}));
  }
  console.log(JSON.stringify({errors: await chrome.evaluate('window.renderErrors')}));
} finally {
  await chrome.close();
}

